<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛkana nakwyeeda bot ɛ Ghalati ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, pɛ daa Bot ɛ dɛl ɛ Ghalat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ghalat</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="mt1">Pɔl</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl nakwyal étɛp bot ɛ Ghalati ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala di pɛ ɛko ɛ bɔs kyee dik di djóoaa mos Tuulki ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:14">Mɛs 13.14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakwyal mɛkana mak ɛ, étɛp ɛdul bot ɛ nazedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ mɛlɔ náá, ye tok ɛni beka di esa náá bɛ di bɔɔ Zɛɛb.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyɛ ɛpebasal náá, ye ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Yezu kɔ mɛlaaba di sa náá, menabɛl bot ɛ esyem bela tsik.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ mɛtyek mɛtɛn nɛ ebá:</para>
  <para style="io">Mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1.1-5</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Sim Mbɛɛ Bhaadal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-10">1.6-10</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Pɔl ɛpekaada bot tsik'ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:14">1.11—2.14</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ mot di ebela ekɛk (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:15-5:1">2.15—5.1</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Zɛɛb eesa náá, mena nàdika ekwom (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:2-12">5.2-12</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Sisim nɛ epuud (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:13-26">5.13-26</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io">Ɛkwyeel pak'en, nɛ ɛsael mɛsa pak'en (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:1-10">6.1-10</ref></char>). Pɔl silal mɛkana mɛ ɛ, nɛ ɛdul ɛ bot mɛlɔ nɛ mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6.11-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Pɔl mot-lwoma ɛ Klisto. Ye ɛ́ tok bot nasa náá, mɛ di mot-lwoma ɛ Klisto, ààkobɛ-bɛak ɛkwosak ɛ mot ɔ. Tin, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Yezu Klisto bɛ nɛ Zɛɛb sɛɛg, mot nagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɔ, mɛ di mos mot-lwoma ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Bis nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bam di wak ɛ, bis sɛɛgaa ɛ étɛp ɛkwyal mɛkana mak nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala kyee dik Ghalati. <verse eid="GAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Klisto naaka nyel'ɛ ɛmet buwa étɛp ɛtsik ɛ mena tɔ mesyem. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp nyɛ neepɛk mena tɔ bhel mbee tsik bot ɛ di mos kɔ bɔs'ak. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Duu nɛ nɔ Ghɛŋ, kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! Amɛn!<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sim Mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Mɛ ɛpedjoka nɛ dáa bi zeleelum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, mot nazedjóo bin kɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ Klisto ɛ, étɛp ɛdu dhiiti mbi mɛlyo mɛ bɛdhiiti bot di eke náá, ye ɛ́ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Deenek, ye tok nɛ dhiiti mbi Mbɛɛ Bhaadal! Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ di ezɛm bin, bɛ kwyɛl ɛ ɛswoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Tin, ye nakoozodi bisɔ bɛmet nɛghu fofop di edus tɔ gwoo ɔɔ, nyɛ zyɛ zɛgoola bin dhiiti Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di ààbɛ tyee wat nɛ yii bis nagoola bin yɛ ɔ, mot tak bela ekɛlok! <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Bis eezelɛɛ yɛ, mɛ ɛpebaabasal bin yɛ nenak. Mot ɛ zɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal sis di ààbɛ tyee wat nɛ yii bi nazegwak ɔɔ, sa bi ààmyaal nyɛ. Mot tak goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbela ekɛlok. <verse eid="GAL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>É di'enek, mɛ ààsaa náá, bot myaala nɛ nam, mɛ saŋ ɛ náá, Zɛɛb myaala nɛ nam. Mɛ ààkwyɛl náá, bot myaala nɛ nam. Mɛ ɛpedi ɛ́ di ekwyɛl náá, bot myaala nɛ nam ɔɔ, pe mɛ tok kwom mɛsa ɛ Klisto.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl nazɛdi mot-lwoma dáa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ goola bin ɛ, ye tok esuwa-esuwa ee mot zesu ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye tok mot nadjɛ mɛ yɛ, nɛghu ɛlyaal mɛ yɛ, deenek ye ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ natel mɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi naagwak mɛfulu mɛ mɛ nadi esa, é sok mɛ nadi mɛ dinaa mot zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ. Bi nɛ gu dáa mɛ nadi ewa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Zɛɛb tɔ tsik mezuk ɛ, nɛ ɛwa zii étɛp ɛgó ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>É sok mɛ nadi tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ, mɛ naadhaa bɛtɛ nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bam eYuda e kɔkɔ membu mam tɔ ɛduwal. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nadi esa zii nɛ ɛwa lyem tɔ mɛtiŋ mɛ bɛbhaab bis.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Tin, Zɛɛb naazeloosɛ́ɛ mɛ tɔ mɔ nyaag'am, ɛsok nɛ mɛ nɛ byel, nyɛ naadjóo mɛ tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. É ɛwala nyɛ nakwos ɛ, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>nyɛ eelyaal mɛ mɔn'ɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ neekɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, di elii dum nɛ nɛ. Tin, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkɛsaa mɛlyo pɛ daa mot, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>bela náá, mɛ ààpatɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, pɛ daa bot ɛ nadi bot ɛ lwoma ɛsok nɛ nam ɔ. Mɛ natɔ́ ɛ pɛ kyee dik Alaabi, bhii tak mɛ eezɛsik pɛ tɔ ghaada Dhamas. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Membu melɛl bhii tak mɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Pyɛɛd, tin, mɛ eezɛdi mɛlu kam nɛ etɛn bis nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààboma nɛ dhiiti mot-lwoma sis bhis Zak mɔn nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Etɛp ee mɛ di ekwyal bin wak ɛ, ye ɛ́ etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ é mis mɛ Zɛɛb, mɛ ààpakɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛ Siili nɛ Silisi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Klisto di pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ dinaa ààgu ɛbhwoob ɛ lam. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Bɛ nazogwak ɛ bot é ke náá: «Mot nadi ewaka mena tɔ tsik mezuk kpaambel ɔ, nyɛ moo mos ɛ́ egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, ee nyɛ nadi ewa zii étɛp ɛgó ɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Tin, bot ɛ Ghalati nadi eduwal Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Bhii tak, ye naazɛkpaa membu kam nɛ ená. Wɔ gwaa, mɛ baazɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bis nɛ Bhaalnabhas zɛnɔɔ Tit. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Mɛ nasik penek ɛ étɛp ɛlooba nɛ sa Zɛɛb natel mɛ ɛ. Tin, bis naazɛboma edi yes bisɔ bɛmet é kwan, bis nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebeea dáa bot ɛ duu ɔ. Mɛ naagoola bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ nadi egoola nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ekwyɛl náá, mɛsa mɛ mɛ nazesa ɛ, nɛghu mɛsa mɛ aasa ɛ, di yii gwyes. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Ghuna Tit, mot bis nɛ nɛ nadi egyee ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot dhaad mbyak eGhɛlɛk, mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ ààbesal nyɛ náá, nyɛ ni beka. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Bela náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn nyɛɛg bis, bot ɛ mɛdhyaaz pɛ ɛko bhimis pɛ si nazeselaa pak'es étɛp ɛsaŋ ɛniigal nyɛ beka. Bot binɔk nasyela tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ les ɛ, étɛp bɛ neebee dáa bis di ekɛ pɛka tɔ ekwom e tsi ɛ, nɛ dáa di náá bis moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl náá, bis di ekwom e tsi. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Tin, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkoobet-betak náá, ɛkwosak ɛ bot ɛ tak sael, etɛɛ náá, etsɛɛtsɛ e Mbɛɛ Bhaadal needi nɛ nen.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Tin, yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ nadi ebeea dáa bot ɛ duu ɔ, yenek ààgwyák mam, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ààsa mbɛk pak bot. Ekukuma binɔk nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ebe mɛ nɛ bhel. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Ghuna, bɛ naabee náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ nadi ààni beka ɔ, dhatyee nyɛ nabaadjɛ Pyɛɛd mɛsa mɛ ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ nani beka ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Tin, dáa Zɛɛb sa náá, Pyɛɛd di mot-lwoma étɛp bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, nyɛ nabaasa ɛ náá, mam di mot-lwoma étɛp bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Dáa bɛ nabee enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb kɔ lam ɛ, wɔ gwaa Zak, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ bot ɛ nadi dhatyee ɛgwiŋ ɛ sɛɛg zɛɛga bot ɛ mendjaala ɔ, zɛsɛɛb bis nɛ Bhaalnabhas mbɔ eghɛŋ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, bɛ eemyaal. Bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkatɔ́ pɛ kyee bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, da bɔɔ ɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Tin, bɛ nazoke nɛ nes ɛ náá, da bis ɛtaala ɛkwyee bɛdjel ɛ bot, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛ naasa yɛ nɛ lyem wat.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd pɛ ghaada Antiɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Deenek, dáa Pyɛɛd nazyɛ pɛ Antiɔs ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛ naalii nɛ nɛ ɛbiyoɛpe é mis mɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Tin, ɛsok nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ Zak nalwom ɔ kum, Pyɛɛd nadi edɛ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bot ɛ nadi ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. E di'enek, dáa bot ɛ tak nakakum ɛ, Pyɛɛd eezɛkyee bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ nadi edɛ ɔ, é kaab bot ɛ nazeni beka ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Bɛdhiiti eYuda zokazɛdu mbee mɛfulu ɛ Pyɛɛd, tin, wɔ gwaa ye baazɛsa náá, Bhaalnabhas zokabaazɛni tɔ mbee mɛsa e mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Dáa mɛ nabee náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi esa esonok ɛnyɔɛpe dáa etsɛɛtsɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di elɛɛ ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ boozɛlii nɛ Pyɛɛd é mis mɛ bot náá: «Wɔy mot di mot dhaad mbyak eYuda ɔ, wɔ ɛpekɛ dáa mot di ààdi mot dhaad mbyak eYuda. “Haa” wɔ aakasa dáa étɛp ɛbesal bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda náá, bɛ du etsi eYuda?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Bisɔ bak, bisɔ byel ɛ́ eYuda, bis tok bot ɛ mesyem, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Tin, mena nɛ guka náá, mot ààdi mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛlooba etsi ɛ Moiiz, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto. Bisɔ pe, bis naadum koŋ yes nɛ Yezu Klisto, etɛɛ náá, bis needi bot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ Yezu Klisto, ààkabɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz. Deenek, etɛɛ náá, mot aanàbela di epiki etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eelooba nɛ etɛp ee etsi ɛ Moiiz di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, mena ɛpesaŋ ɛdi ɛ bot ɛ epiki tɔ Yezu Klisto ɔɔ, da bot ɛ baadi bot ɛ mesyem ɔɔ, deenek ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá Yezu Klisto ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ mesyem e? Ààbɛ ye tok deenek! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ eebaasum esa ee mɛ nabwak ɛ, deenek, mam ɛmet ɛpelyaal náá mɛ ɛ́ mot di ààlooba nɛ etsi ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>É di'enek, dum nɛ etsi, mɛ naazegwyɛ yam tɔ etsi, étɛp mɛ needi nɛ tsik nɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ moo ɛ́ tsela e mɛlaaba bis nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Deenek, ye tok mam di nɛ tsik, ye ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ di nɛ tsik tɔ lam. Etɛɛ náá, tsik mɛ kadi nɛ yɛ mos kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak, ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lam nɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb, mot nakwyɛl mɛ da djɛ tsik'ɛ étɛp mɛ neetsak ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Mɛ ààpɛɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, etsi e Moiiz ɛ di djɛ epiki tɔ mot ɔɔ, deenek, Yezu Klisto nagwyɛ ɛ́ gwyes.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Etsi nɛghu ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb e?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Bot ɛ Ghalati, bi ɛpelyet e! Ɛzɛ zeseeb bin? Bela náá, bɛ nalyaal bin popoopwon dáa Yezu Klisto nabemaa e mɛlaaba ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ ɛdji ɛ bin náá: Ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi ɛ bi nabela Sisim na Dɛɛ «hoo» nɛghu ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi naagwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, da dum koŋ nɛ yɛ? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Étɛp yé bi di elyet deenek? Sa bi nakan nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb ɛ, bi kwyɛl ɛsilal yɛ nɛ ghwyil epuud e? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Bi zebee mbi yenek etuŋ ɛ é gwyes e? Deenek, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi é gwyes. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ bin Sisim nɛ ɛbaasa endem e mɛbwala tɔ len ɔ, bi ke ɛ náá, nyɛ sa ye ɛ́ étɛp bi neelooba etsi «hoo» etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Dáa dinaa, Abalaam naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, Zɛɛb naabee nyɛ dáa mot epiki. <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá: Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ di bɔɔ Abalaam. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ekwyala naaloozelɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ waadjɛ di epiki nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ nɛ. Deenek, Ekwyala naaloozelɛɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak nɛ Abalaam náá: «Bot ɛ membyak djas waasɛɛa mɛtel kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Deenek, Abalaam nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ naasɛɛa mɛtel, ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ eesɛɛa mɛtel dáa Abalaam.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Bot ɛ di ewa lyem tɔ ɛsa sa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ, bɔɔ djas ɛ kala. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá: «Ekɛlok ɛ́ nɛ mot di ààlooba nɛ etɛp djas di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Deenek, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛstɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ di mot epiki é mis mɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá: «Mot ɛ di mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nyɛ waatsak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mena aabaabela ye ɛ́ tɔ Aba 2:4</char></note>.» <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Bela náá, ye tok etsi di edjɛ bot ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Ghuna, ye baakwyalel ɛ náá: «Mot di ewa lyem tɔ ɛlooba nɛ etsi ɔ, nyɛ aabaazobela tsik ɛ, dum nɛ etsi.»<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ Klisto ɛ pɛk mena tɔ mbee baka etsi. Nyɛy ɛmet eebela baka kɔ ɛsu ɛ lena. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá: «Mbee ekɛlok nɛ mot di tselaa é le ɔ.» <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ eebela esɛɛa mɛtel mɛ nakɛkaa Abalaam kɔ lo ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Tin, ye ɛ́ e ɛdum ɛkoŋ ɛ, mena aabela Sisim Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etsi nɛ ekɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, gwakeka, mɛ pookonɔɔ bin dhiiti geka tyee bot di ezeezyɛ nɛ ɛsa ɛ: Yɛ bɛ náá, mot eekwyal mɛkana mɛ mɛlik mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, dhiiti mot sis tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkabaazyɛ zɛdis sonok, nɛghu ɛkɛl dhiiti mɛkpa tɔ tak. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Ye ɛ́ dhatyee ekɛk e Zɛɛb pɛ daa Abalaam nɛ dha'ɛ. Ekwyala ààlɛɛ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ bɛdha bɛ», dhatyee náá, ye lii ɛ nɛ bot ɛbuɛpe. Tin, ye zolii ɛ nɛ mot ngɔt, dáa ye di kwyala ɛ: «Nɛ dha'ɔ.» Dha tak kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Gwakeka sa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: Mɛkana mɛ mɛlik mɛ Zɛɛb naloozekwyal ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ, ye tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ baazɛsaabel nɛ etsi dinaa, ye nazɛsael ɛ bhis membu bɛdhet-ɛná nɛ mɛkam-mɛlɛl (430) ɛ. Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ekɛk e Zɛɛb aadi ɛ́ yii gwyes. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, esa e lyak Zɛɛb di edjɛ ɛ belaa ɛ dum nɛ etsi ɔɔ, é di'enek, ye ɛ́ aanàkabaadi kɔ ɛsu ɛ ekɛk. Ghuna ye ɛ́ dum nɛ ekɛk ɛ, Zɛɛb nasa enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ nɛ Abalaam.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛsɔ mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Tin, etsi ɛ́ étɛp yé? Etsi nazɛkɛlaa ɛ étɛp mesyem mɛ bot neenyen popoopwon, kɛkum dwoo dha ɛ Abalaam aabyel ɛ, mot ekɛk bak naseaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. Etsi tak, Zɛɛb nadjɛ ye ɛ́, é mɛmbɔ mɛ efofop, tin, efofop ɛboodjɛ etsi tak nɛ mot, étɛp nyɛ neekɛgoola yɛ pɛ daa bot. Mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Moiiz. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Étɛp ngoola-ngoola needi, ye nyɔ ɛ bot ɛbá ɛdi nɛ tɛp, bela náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ mot ngɔt.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ náá, etsi nɛ ekɛk e Zɛɛb ààkɛ ze wat e? Ye tok deenek! Ye ɛpedi ɛdi náá, etsi ɛpedjɛ tsik'ɔɔ, pe epiki nawaazozyɛ ɛ́ tɔ etsi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Deenek, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá, bot djas ɛ́ si bhel mesyem, tɛp tak ɛ́ dinaa, ekɛk e Zɛɛb goka nɛ ɛsael ɛ, kɔ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Ɛsok nɛ ɛwala ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kum, mena nadika ɛ si bhel etsi, ebwood náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb tak nyen. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>É di'enek, etsi nadi ɛ́ mbaalel yenaka kɛkum ɛwala ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Klisto, etɛɛ náá, mena needika bot ɛ epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Dáa ye di mos náá, ɛwala ɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb eezekum ɛ, mena tokapɛ si mɛko mɛ dhiiti mbaalel.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas moo ɛ́ bɔɔ Zɛɛb dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Tin, biyɔ djas bot ɛ zeduwa Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ Yezu Klisto ɔ, bi moo ɛ́ dáa Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Tin, ye tokapɛ nɛ mbɛk pak mot dhaad mbyak eYuda nɛ mot dhaad mbyak eGhɛlɛk, pak kwom mot nɛ sɛɛŋɛlɛ mot, pak moma nɛ motom, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas bi moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ Klisto ɔɔ, deenek biyɔ pe ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ dha Abalaam, tin, bi ɛ́ waabela esa e lyak ee Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="s">Wɔ tokapɛ kwom, tin wɔ moo ɛ́ mɔɔ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Gwakeka sa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: Dáa dinaa mɔɔ lyak dinaa mɔɔ dhyeeb ɛ, nyɛ tok nɛ mbɛk nɛ kwom mot, ye nakoozobɛ náá nyɛy ɛ́ di nakuma esa binek. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Tin, nyɛ gwak ɛ nɛ bot ɛ di ewyel nyɛ ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ endɔmbɛ di ebaal esa bɛ ɔ, deenek, kɛkum ɛwala ɛ sɛɛg nakwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Tyee wat nɛ menabɛlka djas, é ghɛŋ mena nadika bɔɔ dhyeeb ɛ, mena nadika ɛ ekwom si bhel esonok mbɛs di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Tin, dáa ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nakoobal ɛ nakadjala ɛ, Zɛɛb naazɛdhis mɔn'ɛ. Mɔɔ tak ɛ moma nabya nyɛ, nyɛ nawyeelaa ɛ si etsi e Moiiz, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>étɛp nyɛ neepɛk bot ɛ nadi si bhel etsi ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ ɛsa náá mena needika bɔɔ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Étɛp ye neelyaal nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bɔn, Zɛɛb eedhis tɔ bhum elyem binaka Sisim mɔn'ɛ, Sisim di etuud náá: «Abha» ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ Saag'am. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Deenek, wɔ tokapɛ kwom, wɔ moo ɛ́ mɔn, dáa dinaa, wɔ ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ waadjɛ wɔ esa e lyak nyɛ nakwom étɛp bɔɔ bɛ ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esimza ɛ Pɔl dum nɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>É sok bi nadi bi dinaa ààgu Zɛɛb ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ekwom e bɛzɛɛb ɛ dinaa nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ bɛ tok bɛtɛtɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Nenak, bi eezegu Zɛɛb, nɛghu náá, Zɛɛb eezegu bin. «Haa» ye kabaasa dáa, bi baasik si bhel esonok mbɛs di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ, esa ee dinaa ye tok nɛ mɛtaŋ, ààbɛ nɛ mɛbwala ɛ? Bi baakwyɛl ɛ, bi baabula ekwom bɔɔ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Bi nɛ kwyɛl ɛduwal mɛlu, bɛngɔn, bɛdhiiti mɛwala baazɛnɔɔ membu ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ kɛŋ nɛ nen etɛɛ náá, mezuk mɛ mɛ nazuk nɛ nen ɛzɛkɛgwyɛ gwyes.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, mɛ ɛpedjaala nen náá, dika dáa mam, etɛɛ náá, mam pe, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ dáa biyɔ. Bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa mɛ ɛbiyo. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ nagoola bin mbɛɛ bhaadal é sok mɛkɛn ɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ nadi ebɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Tin, dáa bi nabee nyel'am nadi ekpaŋ ɛ, ye nabɛ nɛ nen ɛ dáa mɛbhowal. Tin, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbyen mɛ, ààkin mɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi naamyaal mɛ dáa fofop ɛ Zɛɛb nɛghu dáa Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Deenek, mɛmyaala mɛ bi nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ moo wo e? Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ tyaasɛs étɛp ɛbaŋa bin náá, ye ɛ́ ɛpedi ɛ́ di náá ye ɛsael ɔɔ, pe ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi nadis mis men djɛ mɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Nenak mɛ moo ɛ́ mot mɛbhuka men étɛp mɛ nɛ lɛɛ bin etsɛɛtsɛ e?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot di wa lyem nɛ nen, bela náá, tɔ ɛwa lyem tak, ye tok nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. Tin, bɛ saŋ ɛ ɛbɛk ɛ mena, etɛɛ náá bi neewa lyem nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Ɛnyɔ náá, mot wa lyem tɔ embɛɛ esesɛɛ é mɛwala djas. Deenek, sa yɛ ààzoodi é sok mɛ di sama wat nɛ nen ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Bɔɔ bam, mɛ ɛpebaazuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ len dáa mezuk mɛ moma di suula étɛp nyɛ neebya ɛ, kɛkum dwoo Klisto aabe di tɔ len ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>É ɛwala ɛlak, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛdi edi wat nɛ nen, étɛp mɛ neelii dáa di egoka ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ ààgu sa ɛsa kɔ ɛsu ɛ len.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geka ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Aghaad nɛ yɛ Saala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Lɛɛka mɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛdi ɛ si etsi ɔ: bi ààgwak sa etsi di elɛɛ ɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Etɛɛ náá, ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá, Abalaam naabya bɔɔ ba, ngɔt, nyɛ nabya ɛ bɛ nɛ Aghaad kwom moma, dhiiti bɛ nɛ Saala moma nadi ààdi kwom ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Tin, mɔɔ nyɛ nabya bɛ nɛ moma kwom ɔ, nabyel ɛ nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ elyem e bot. Yɛ kaabɛ mɔɔ nyɛ nabya bɛ nɛ moma nadi ààdi kwom ɔ, nyɛ nabyel ɛ dáa Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Tin, tɛp'enek ɛ nɛ dhiiti ɛsulel ɛ sis, etɛɛ náá, boa binɔk bɛbá lyaal ɛ mɛbhɛŋ mɛmbá. Wat ɛ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi, bɔɔ byel penek ɔ ekwom: ye ɛ́ Aghaad. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Bela náá, Aghaad ɛ́ ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi di pɛ kyee dik Alaabi ɛ. Ye ɛ́ di mos ghaada Yeluzalɛm'aak, etɛɛ náá, ghaada Yeluzalɛm nɛ bot djas di tɔ tak ɛ́ tɔ ekwom. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Tin, ghaada Yeluzalɛm di tɔ gwoo ɛ, ye tok tɔ ekwom, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ́ di nyɛɛg'ena.<verse eid="GAL 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Etɛɛ náá, ekwyala lɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">«Dia tɔ mɛmyaala, wɔy kwyiid moma, wɔy moma di ààbya ɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Kɛka nɛ ekim e mɛmyaala, wɔy mot di ààgu mɛkpaa mɛ ɛbɛl ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ moma zepɛɛaa ɔ, bɛ ɛpebu dhaa bɔɔ moma di é ɛbá ɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Eza 54.1</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Yɛka bɛ biyɔ, bɔn nyɛɛg bam ɔ, bi ɛ́ bɔɔ nabyel tɔ ekɛk e Zɛɛb ɔ, tyee wat nɛ Izak. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ dáa ye nadi sok ɛ, mɔɔ nabyel tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ elyem bot ɔ, nadi etiig mɔɔ nabyel, dáa Sisim Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa di esael é dwoo ɛlak mos. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Tin, ekwyala lɛɛ dáa? «Sɔa kwom moma nɛ mɔn'ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɔɔ kwom moma ààgoka nɛ ɛkaa esa e lyak bɛ nɛ mɔɔ moma di ààbɛ kwom ɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɔ aabela ye ɛ́, tɔ mɛkana mɛ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Mɛk 21.10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Deenek, bɔn nyɛɛg bam, mena tokeka bɔn kwom moma, menaka ɛ́ bɔn moma di ààdi kwom ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Nàsaabka mɛpɛka mɛ bi nazebela ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Klisto nadis mena si bhel etsi eYuda ɛ, étɛp mena needi ààbaadi ekwom. Lyelka bham, yɛ ààgoka náá, bi baabula si bhel ekwom etsi.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Gwakeka, mam Pɔl, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, bi eemyaal ɛniigelaa beka ɔɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ náá, Klisto tokapɛ dhiiti vaŋ mot étɛp'en. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Mɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ nɛ botom djas di emyaal náá, bɛ niigal bɛ beka ɔ náá, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi djas. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Bi naazebɛka nɛ Klisto, biyɔ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsaa náá, bi di bot ɛ epiki é mis mɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛlooba nɛ etsi ɔ, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb tokapɛ nɛ nen. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔ, mena waka ɛbwaalel ɛ lena ɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy mot di esa náá bot di epiki é mis mɛ ɔ. Ye ɛ́ sa mena di bwoodka nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ Sisim na dɛɛ, di enyen tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛdi tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔɔ, ɛni beka nɛghu ààni beka tok nɛ mɛtaŋ, tin, sa di nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ ye ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di enyen tɔ kwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi eekan ɛsum kaab ɛnyɔɛpe! «Haa» ɛzɛ kaala bin ze étɛp bi needi ààlooba nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e Zɛɛb? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Mbii mɛlyo menek ààpadus pɛ daa Zɛɛb mot nadjóo bin ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Bi ɛ kobaka! Ba pu leviid batsa nɛ sa náá, tsim di esaa mapa nɛ ye ɛ́ ghamta. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Dum nɛ Ghɛŋ, mam, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nen, mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi tok nɛ dhiiti esimza sis. Deenek, mot ɛ sa ɛzɛm tɔ len ɔɔ, nyɛ aawaa é feŋ, ye nakozoodi zɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Yɛka bɛ mam ɔ, bɔn nyɛɛg bam, yɛ pe di náá, mɛ ɛpebaagoola bot bhaadal ɛni beka ɔɔ, «haa» ye ɛ́ kɔ mɛsɔ mɛ yé mɛ baadi etiigaa? E di'enek, ɛgoola bot mɛkpa mɛ embee esesɛɛ nasael nɛ Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba ɛ tokapɛ dhiiti vaŋ sonok! <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Tin, bot ɛ di ekus ɛghuub tɔ len ɔ, bɛ gheetetɔ́ nɛ ɛsa mbee mɔɔ: bɛ dis bhum ekaab bɔɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛkwosak ɛ Sisim nɛ ɛkwosak epuud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, bi nadjóoaa ɛ étɛp bi needi ààbaadi é ekwom. É di'enek, sa bi ààkasa náá, ɛdusa bi zedusaa si bhel ɛ, di nɛ nen tyee mɛfulu mɛ ɛlooba nɛ ɛkwosak epuud. É di'enek, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi bet náá, kwyɛl djɛɛd bin, étɛp bi neekwyeeel pak'en. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Etɛɛ náá, etsi djas ɛ sɛɛga tɔ mɛkpa mak: «Ye goka ɛ́ wɔ kwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛpekwaalel nɛ ɛdyaadel pak'en dáa bɛtit ɔɔ, bi ɛ kobaka, bi ɛzɛkɛgonel pak'en.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Tin, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Betka náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ djɛɛd bin, é di'enek, bi aanàkabaasa ɛkwosak ɛ epuud. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Etɛɛ náá, e egwyes epuud ɛ́ nɛ zyaala nɛ egwyes e Sisim ɛ. Tin, egwyes e Sisim ɛ́ nɛ zyaala nɛ egwyes e epuud. Deenek, ye ɛ́ nɛ zyaala pak'ɔɔ, tyee náá, bi needi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa sa elyem bin di kwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, Sisim ɛ di edjɛɛd bin ɔɔ, deenek, bi tokapɛ si bhel etsi.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Bela náá, mɛsa mɛ epuud nyen ɛ: tɔ mɛzɔ, tɔ dɔaab, tɔ mbee mɛfulu mɛ ɛdi ɛbá, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>tɔ ɛduwal ɛ bɛnaghisɛ, tɔ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ, tɔ mbee lyem, tɔ mɛwɔ, tɔ ɛwu, tɔ ɛkwye ɛ́ lyem, tɔ mɛbaka, tɔ bhyen ɛdi ɛ sama nɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ, tɔ swaka, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>tɔ egwyes, tɔ elangi, tɔ mɛbyoŋ mbɛs zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti mesyem di nɔŋel nɛ yenek ɛ. Nenak, mɛ ɛpedul bin mɛlɔ, dáa mɛ nadul bin yɛ sok ɛ: bot ɛ di esa deenek ɔ, bɛ aanàkwaabela di tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Yɛ kabɛ bhum Sisim na Dɛɛ di edjɛ ɔ, ye ɛ́: mɛkwyɛla, mɛmyaala, egwyem, ɛmaad ɛ lyem, embɛɛ, enɛm esa, nɛ ɛdum ɛkoŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>mɛtela, ɛdil ɛ nuub. Ye tok nɛ tsi wat di ebyen mbi etɛp binek. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Bot ɛ di bot ɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ, naazebem epuud bɔɔ, nɛ mɛkwosak mɔɔ zɛnɔɔ egwyes bɔɔ kɔ mɛlaaba. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Dáa ye dinaa, tsik'enaka ɛ́ tsik Sisim ɛ, betka náá, mena kɛka tɔ Sisim.<verse eid="GAL 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsi ɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Sa mena ààdika nɛ ɛben ɛ nyel, djhookatka ebeme pak'enaka, sa mena ààdi nɛ swaka pak'enaka.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Bɛpelka mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp pak'en</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ zɛbelaa esa pɔtɔ ɔɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ di nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb ɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbulal nyɛ é ze tɔ egwyem. Bi ɛ́ kobaka, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ bɛmet ɛzɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Kwyeelka pak'en da bi ɛ́ bebɛpel mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp bin. Deenek ɛ, bi aakɛ dáa etsi e Klisto di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Mot di ebun náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot é mis mɛ bot, ghuna nyɛ ààval dhiiti sonok é mis mɛ bot ɔ, nyɛ kɔɔ ɛ nyel'ɛ met. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot pookosiiza mɛsa mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, nyɛ bee náá, nyɛ ɛpekɛ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, tin, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ myaala nɛ nyel'ɛ met, ààbɛ náá, nyɛ kagek nɛ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ sis. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot nɛ mot goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbɛp mɛkɔm mɛ etɛp bɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Mot di elyoaa mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaa esa nyɛ di nɛ ye ɛ́, nɛ mot di elyo nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Sa mot ààkɔɔ nyel'ɛ, bɛ ààsa mɛsɛŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Sa mot aabɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɛ, ye ɛ́ sa nyɛ aabɔ́k ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Mot ɛbɛ esonok étɛp ɛkwosak ɛ epuud bɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aabela ɛ esa e puud, ye ɛ́ ɛsyee. Tin, mot ɛ kabɛ esa e sisim ɔɔ, nyɛ aabela ɛ esa e Sisim, ye ɛ́ tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Sa mena ààbula bhis é ɛsa mɛnyɔ nɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, mena aawa zii ɔɔ, mena waabɔ́keka mbɛɛ bhum mɛsa mena, é ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Tin, é sok mena di bela ba mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛ, dhjoosaka mɛnyɔ nɛ bot djas, daŋ-daŋ ɛ nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bena, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emwana e mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Beeka, eboo ekyeeb ee mɛ di kwyal bin nenak'aak, mɛ kwyal ye ɛ́ nɛ mbɔ'am met. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Bot ɛ di kwyɛl ɛbesal bin náá, bi niigelaa beka ɔ, ye ɛ́ bot ɛ di saŋ ɛghɛɛaa mɛnyel é mis mɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa mɛ epuud. Bɛ kwyɛl ɛ náá, bɛ di ààtiigaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Klisto é mɛlaaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Bot ɛni beka ɔ, bɔɔ bɛmet ààlooba nɛ etsi djas. Bɛ kwyɛl náá, bɛ niigal bin beka, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neediig bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ ndem di é mɛnyel men ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, mɛ diig bet ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Ghɛŋ'ena Yezu Klisto é mɛlaaba. Tin, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ Klisto kɔ mɛlaaba, esa e bɔs djas eezegwyɛ é yam mis. Mam moo ɛ, mɛ eezegwyɛ dum nɛ esa e bɔs. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Étɛp tak ɛ́ dinaa, ɛni beka, nɛghu ɛdi ààni beka, ye tok nɛ dhiiti mɛtaŋ. Sa di nɛ mɛtaŋ ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb djɛ mena tsik na bes. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Dum nɛ bot ɛ di kɛ tɔ ɛlooba nɛ mɛlyo mak ɔ, beta náá: egwyem nɛ boo lyem ghoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb di nɛ nɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ kɔ Yisalaɛl ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="GAL 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Kana mos, sa mot ààbaawa mɛ tɔ tsik mezuk, etɛɛ náá, endem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndem, tɔ lii eGhɛlɛk kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ edho nakuma kwom di ewa kɔ kwom'ɛ, ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ náá, Pɔl ɛ́ mot ɛ Yezu.</char></note> e mezuk mɛ di nɛ yɛ é nyel'am'aak lyaal ɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="GAL 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di tɔ esisim bin. Amen!<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
